                        "entry_id": "417a0c82-8f9a-31aa-bad5-13bc32f46c16",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A body of religious law forming a part of the Islamic tradition based on the scriptures of Islam, particularly the Qur'an and hadith."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
